{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19235","headline":"和陈许王尚书酬白少傅侍郎长句因通简汝洛旧游之什 · 刘禹锡","name":"和陈许王尚书酬白少傅侍郎长句因通简汝洛旧游之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寥廓高翔不可追，风云失路蹔相随。\n方同洛下书生咏，又见军前大将旗。\n雪里命宾开玉帐，饮中请号驻金巵。\n竹林一自王戎去，嵇阮虽贫兴未衰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}